# A size-13 multiset of residues in {1..13}. The number of such
# multisets is C(13+13-1,13)=C(25,13)=5,200,300 -- too many to brute all.
# But the apex tournament only sees residue VALUES, and runs of EQUAL
# residues collapse to coincident circle points. The distinct cases that
# matter for a TIGHT candidate are governed by how the 13 residues tile
# Z/14. We enumerate the structurally relevant families.

